<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            4.36.010  Rental
payments.</span></b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>  All rentals covering King County tax property and King
County fee simple property shall be paid to the manager of the facilities
management division.  (Ord. 14199 § 82, 2001:  Res. 9490 (part), 1945).</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
